        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi katika kazi hiyo nilipokuwa nikienda Dameski, mwenye mamlaka na maagizo ya wakuu wa makuhani; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee Mfalme, ndipo wakati wa adhuhuri njiani naliona nuru inatoka mbinguni ipitayo mwangaza wa jua, ikinimulikia mimi, na wale waliofuatana nami pande zote. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tukaanguka nchi sote, nikasikia sauti ikisema nami kwa lugha ya kiebrania, Sauli! Sauli! Mbona waniudhi? Ni vigumu kwako kuupiga mateke mchokoo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami nikasema, Wewe u nani, Bwana? Bwana akaniambia, Mimi ni Yesu, ambaye wewe unaniudhi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
